  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "The objective is to create a decision worksheet so that everyone on the team agrees which decisions each person is responsible for.\n\n### The assignment\n\nAs a group, create a list of all the decisions that the team faces on a regular basis. Note down the point person who is responsible for each decision. Then apply the \"Stop Light\u00e2\u20ac\u009d system to each decision:\n\n* Green light = needs no approval\n\n* Yellow light = needs a quick answer from (note team members' names)\n\n* Red light = needs significant review by (note team members' names)\n\nNote any team members who have more than their fair share of responsibility. Take this opportunity to change processes or people that impede effective decision making. Discuss these decisions with your manager or team leader so that the team agrees on an approach that is both effective and empowering.",
